      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Right in the middle of Barinov and Elena's romantic moment, the front door opens and Lyova walks in with his mother after missing their train. When Vera Ivanovna introduces herself as Lyova's mother rather than Viktor Petrovich's, a humiliated Elena storms out.",
      "gap": 0.8
